            "title": "China trade talks are set to resume on Oct. 10",
            "snippets": [
              "Chinese Vice Premier Liu He will be representing the delegation from Beijing, sources tell CNBC.\nBusiness\nTech\nVideo\nPRO",
              "# China trade talks are set to resume on Oct. 10\n- Trade talks between the U.S. and China are set to resume Oct. 10-11 in Washington, three people close to the talks tell CNBC.\n- Chinese Vice Premier Liu He will be representing the delegation from Beijing, one of the people told CNBC.",
              "Trade talks between the U.S. and China are set to resume Oct. 10-11 in Washington, three people close to the talks told CNBC on Thursday.\n\nChinese Vice Premier Liu He will be representing the delegation from Beijing, one of the people told CNBC.\n\nLiu visited Washington this spring sporting the title \"special envoy,\" empowering him to negotiate on behalf of President Xi Jinping and pledge in the Oval Office with President Donald Trump to buy American soybeans",
              "But Liu was stripped of that title on a subsequent trip, after Communist Party hardliners balked at some of the concessions to which he had agreed.\n\nThe White House, the Treasury Department and Office of the U.S. Trade Representative did not respond to CNBC's requests for comment about the date for the resumption of talks.\n\nTrump administration officials have said they expected the stalled talks with Beijing to resume next month",
              "{\"description\":\"Chinese Vice Premier Liu He will be representing the delegation from Beijing, sources tell CNBC.\",\"headline\":\"China trade talks are set to resume on Oct. 10\",\"dateCreated\":\"2019-09-26T21:10:18+0000\",\"datePublished\":\"2019-09-26T21:10:18+0000\",\"dateModified\":\"2019-09-27T12:15:49+0000\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Kevin Breuninger\"},{\"name\":\"Kayla Tausche\"}],\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"CNBC\",\"foundingDate\":\"1989-04-17\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.instagram.com/cnbc\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cnbc\",\"https://twitter.com/cnbc\",\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNBC\",\"https://www.youtube.com/cnbc\"]},\"articleSection\":\"Politics\",\"keywords\":[\"cnbc\",\"Articles\",\"Xi Jinping\",\"Donald Trump\",\"U.S. Economy\",\"White House\",\"Politics\",\"Trade\",\"Breaking News: Politics\",\"Political Leaders\",\"US Economy\",\"China Economy\",\"source:tagname:CNBC US Source\"],\"video\":{\"description\":\"Kayla Tausche reports that trade talks between the U.S. and China are going to resume in October. With CNBC's Melissa Lee and the Fast Money traders, Tim Seymour, Karen Finerman, Dan Nathan and Steve Grasso.\",\"duration\":\"PT2M44S\",\"name\":\"US-China trade talks resuming in DC October 10\",\"uploadDate\":\"2019-09-26T21:09:46+0000\"}}"
            ]
